  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Esoteric Art — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level you have learned to expand your domain. The inside of your domain counts as your painting’s subspace, expanding to the same size as your subspace and following the same rules, except your <em>Ink Shikigami</em> and <em>Traps</em> are imbued with your guaranteed hit. At initiative 20, two different <em>Impasto Canvas</em> effects of your choice happen (if you choose <em>Ink Shikigami</em>, they still cost Cursed Energy).</p>",
